{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1213229-from-anime-literature-and-more-artifacts-you-wanna-make","id":1213229,"title":"From anime, literature, and more Artifacts you wanna make","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","Exalted"],"posts":[{"date":"2018-04-29T17:21:24-07:00","id":1213229,"title":"From anime, literature, and more Artifacts you wanna make","content":"<span style=\"color:#333333\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana\">What are some other artifacts you'd want to bring to Exalted such as Excalibur itself and the scabbard</span></span>","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12378-fma245","name":"FMA245","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"165"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-04-29T17:29:33-07:00","id":1213234,"title":"","content":"I'd made some initial attempts to write up an orichalcum sword inspired by one interpretation of Excalibur that says the sword would emit a blinding light upon being drawn from its sheath. Probably borrow some mechanics from the Sunflash chakram in <i>Arms </i>for an anima banner. The original idea was to make it a Five-Dot sword as difficult as Stormcaller, since it blinds your own allies as well as your enemies.<br /> <br /> I hunted down the stats on the Scabbard of the Living Weapon, but haven't done much to update it.<br /> <br /> I'd like to get more done on the rocket hammer inspired by <i>Overwatch's </i>Reinhardt and <i>God Eater's</i> Boost Hammer.<br /> <br /> I have some vague plans for an adamant sword based on Cloud Strife's Ultima Weapon.<br /> <br /> I haven't gotten very far with Ruby Rose's Crescent Rose, as we have no canonical Third Edition rules for firearms, yet, and I'm not eager to fully commit to making homebrew rules for such on top of the Evocations.<br /> <br /> Designing warstriders that transform between different forms is tricky.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>formerly Tornado Wolf, formerly Inugami","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/636-sunder-the-gold","name":"Sunder the Gold","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar636_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5515"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-04-29T17:39:59-07:00","id":1213240,"title":"","content":"I have to look back at the various magical weapons in Lord Marksman and Vanadis some time.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><span style=\"color:#00ffff\">I have approximate knowledge of many things.</span><br /> <a href=\"https://forum.rpg.net/index.php?threads/wip-xenoblade-chronicles-the-sword-can-see-the-future.835575/\" target=\"_blank\">Write up as I play Xenoblade Chronicles.</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/158-isator-levi","name":"Isator Levi","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar158_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"17901"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-04-29T17:45:23-07:00","id":1213241,"title":"","content":"Too many.<br /> <br /> 10 characters","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Read my shit at my <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/271207-sandact6-homebrew-topic\" target=\"_blank\">homebrew</a> topic, 2.5e and 3e material!<br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1263020-alchemicals-2-0-3e-conversion-charm-design-request\" target=\"_blank\">Play Alchemical's in 3e now</a>, you're welcome.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1183-sandact6","name":"Sandact6","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1183_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1236"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-04-29T19:46:08-07:00","id":1213280,"title":"","content":"Oh! There are quite a few weapons from across the Dark Souls series with some neat concepts that I'd want to try bringing in and expanding upon.<br /> <br /> \u200bI think things that particularly stand out are the Profaned Greatsword (mostly for the description of the Profaned Flame as instilling a terrible, burning ambition), and basically any arms with the designation &quot;of Want&quot; in their title; just that stark name that strikes the mind with a power from deep longing turning into horrific greed.<br /> <br /> \u200bHmm, the Dark/Humanity in general has some elements of hunger, longing for contact and companionship and a greasy, cloying, visceral image to it that can align very nicely with some takes on soulsteel...","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><span style=\"color:#00ffff\">I have approximate knowledge of many things.</span><br /> <a href=\"https://forum.rpg.net/index.php?threads/wip-xenoblade-chronicles-the-sword-can-see-the-future.835575/\" target=\"_blank\">Write up as I play Xenoblade Chronicles.</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":4}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/158-isator-levi","name":"Isator Levi","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar158_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"17901"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-04-29T20:30:39-07:00","id":1213301,"title":"","content":"Some day I'm going to stat Gandiva and it will be glorious.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/13313-sith_happens","name":"Sith_Happens","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar13313_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2017"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1177"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-04-29T20:36:08-07:00","id":1213304,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Sandact6</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1213229-from-anime-literature-and-more-artifacts-you-wanna-make?p=1213241#post1213241\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Too many.<br /> <br /> 10 characters</div> </div> </div> </div>10 Characters (Artifact 4)<br /> <br /> It is said that the Endlessly Witty Warrior grew lonesome and bored in the aftermath of the Primordial War, so he journeyed farther into the Wyld than any before him had dared. His m to seek out new forms of conquest. Centuries later, he returned with this weapon, a chain whip of unidentifiable material that is inscribed with shallow, nearly invisible symbols from an unknown language. The wielders of 10 Characters have been many and varied in the ages that followed, though they all shared one universal quality: loquaciousness in combat.<br /> <br /> No type of Exalted is dissonant with 10 Characters, even those Exalted who are normally dissonant with strange materials. Only Solar Exalted are resonant with 10 Characters, but others who steal, borrow, or emulate the charm Poised Lion Attitude may become resonant after mastering And Another Thing: Some Mysteries are Still To Be Written.<br /> <br /> Upon attuning to 10 Characters, the wielder may awaken An Uncharacteristically Concise Name: Horizon-Spanning Discourse for free.<br /> <br /> An Uncharacteristically Concise Name: Horizon-Spanning Discourse<br /> Cost: 3m; Mins: Essence 1;<br /> Type: Supplemental<br /> Keywords: None<br /> Duration: A matter of opinion<br /> <br /> Through some trickery of the wyld, time twists and stretches with the flick of 10 Character's chains, binding the moment of a strike into an eternity. This evocation does not supplement an attack, but a Social action taken in combat, such as a Presence or Performance roll. It allows the wielder to say much more during their combat action than might ordinarily be possible in the midst of pitched combat, stretching out their dialogue as far as necessary to make their point. While it always lasts at least as long as necessary for the social action to be made, liberal extensions of dialectic spacetime may require repeat activations at the discretion of the Storyteller.<br /> <br /> A Most Elegant and Obligatory Punishment of Unbecoming Brevity<br /> Cost: 5m,1i; Mins: Essence 1<br /> Type: Supplemental<br /> Keywords: Decisive-Only<br /> Duration: Instant<br /> Prerequisite Charms: An Uncharacteristically Concise Name: Horizon-Spanning Discourse<br /> <br /> Those who would ignore 10 Characters do so at their peril. This charm may only be activated on a round immediately following the use of An Uncharacteristically Concise Name: Horizon-Spanning Discourse, against the same opponent who was subject to the previous round's social influence attempt. <br /> <br /> If the opponent responded with complete silence, not deigning to reply with any words at all, this evocation adds double 10s to the damage roll, and the wielder retains an extra point of initiative upon returning to base initiative.<br /> If the opponent responded with a well-reasoned and complete sentence, this evocation only adds the extra point of base initiative.<br /> If the opponent is still responding, even while the wielder attacks, the attack automatically fails.<br /> If, however, the opponent offered only a succinct reply--no matter how dull or witty, proper or profane--10 Characters finds its mark nigh-unerringly. The attack benefits from an automatic success, ignores hardness, rolls double 9s on the damage roll, and the wielder retains an extra point of initiative upon returning to base initiative.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":14}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2223-ketrus","name":"Ketrus","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"398"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-04-29T21:56:35-07:00","id":1213329,"title":"","content":"That was great, <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2223-ketrus\" style=\"background-image:url('data:image/svg+xml;base64,');\" class=\"b-bbcode-user b-bbcode-user--has-avatar js-bbcode-user\" data-userid=\"2223\" data-vbnamecard=\"2223\">Ketrus</a>.<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Ketrus</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1213229-from-anime-literature-and-more-artifacts-you-wanna-make?p=1213304#post1213304\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">An Uncharacteristically Concise Name: Horizon-Spanning Discourse</div> </div> </div> </div>I kinda want to make an Evocation that expands from this, which permits another weird trope regarding time: namely, activating it while under some sort of countdown to something bad happening (like, someone giving you until the count of ten before you're disqualified from the match, a burning fuse leading to a keg of firedust big enough to destroy the ship, a manse whose self-destruct activates when the sand in an hourglass runs out, or being told that the moon will fall in three days' time), you can suspend the bad event long enough to complete a task (such as carrying out an entire conversation complete with dramatic pauses and humorous asides, running out of the building, jury-rigging an escape raft, or finishing the daiklave you were building), in exchange for the timer resuming with <i>exactly</i> one turn left on the clock.<br /> <br /> ________<br /> <br /> I intend on making some enchanted flying carpets, now that my character can produce arbitrary amounts of silk.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>He/him","edited":{"userid":177,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/177-thecountalucard","user":"TheCountAlucard","date":". 04-30-2018, 01:28 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/177-thecountalucard","name":"TheCountAlucard","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar177_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"10857"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-04-29T22:40:50-07:00","id":1213337,"title":"","content":"Marvel Style Mjolnir and Casters from Outlaw Star are totally a thing for me...","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/754-eldagusto","name":"Eldagusto","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar754_2.gif","title":"Banned","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"6435"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-04-30T01:01:06-07:00","id":1213352,"title":"","content":"One day, I'm gonna write up all of Bleach's weaponry as Artifacts.<br /> <br /> Yes, even the one that turns into a caterpillar poison devil baby.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/823884-3e-the-artifact-and-evocation-workshop?p=943303#post943303\" target=\"_blank\">Evocations for the demonic tattoos gained from the Pact with Mara sorcerous initiation</a> || <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/823884-3e-the-artifact-and-evocation-workshop?p=907071#post907071\" target=\"_blank\">Pyre-Kindler (Soulsteel and Red Jade Grimscythe, Artifact 3)</a> || <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1072019-soulsteel-stormcaller-concept-gravedigger?p=1074897#post1074897\" target=\"_blank\">Tenebrous Descent (Stormcaller's Black Jade Reaver Daiklave cousin, Artifact 5)</a><br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1074256-combat-with-corebook-shikari-antagonists?p=1074303#post1074303\" target=\"_blank\">Advice for running the corebook shikari antagonists</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":3}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3443-aluminiumtrioxid","name":"aluminiumtrioxid","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3443_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jul 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"606"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-04-30T01:34:14-07:00","id":1213360,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Isator Levi</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1213229-from-anime-literature-and-more-artifacts-you-wanna-make?p=1213280#post1213280\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Oh! There are quite a few weapons from across the Dark Souls series with some neat concepts that I'd want to try bringing in and expanding upon.<br /> <br /> \u200bI think things that particularly stand out are the Profaned Greatsword (mostly for the description of the Profaned Flame as instilling a terrible, burning ambition), and basically any arms with the designation &quot;of Want&quot; in their title; just that stark name that strikes the mind with a power from deep longing turning into horrific greed.<br /> <br /> \u200bHmm, the Dark/Humanity in general has some elements of hunger, longing for contact and companionship and a greasy, cloying, visceral image to it that can align very nicely with some takes on soulsteel...</div> </div> </div> </div>I've also looked into making some Soulsborne weapons. Right now I'm working on the Holy Moonlight Sword (the Bloodborne version) and the Nameless King's Sword-spear. I've also slowly been making Samus Aran's Powered Suit into a set of artifact armor, but I've put that on hiatus with the inevitable approach of more Gunzosha info","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/13696-knurlurzhad","name":"Knurlurzhad","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar13696_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jul 2017"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"74"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-04-30T01:44:42-07:00","id":1213362,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>aluminiumtrioxid</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1213229-from-anime-literature-and-more-artifacts-you-wanna-make?p=1213352#post1213352\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">One day, I'm gonna write up all of Bleach's weaponry as Artifacts.<br /> <br /> Yes, even the one that turns into a caterpillar poison devil baby.</div> </div> </div> </div><br /> Now I will be dreaming of that day. I'm a huge fan of Bleach and it has been a great source of inspiration for Exalted.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12575-gaara","name":"Gaara","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"62"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-04-30T01:52:55-07:00","id":1213364,"title":"","content":"Omni-Directional Maneuvering Gear (paired Short Daiklaives). It was obviously manufactured in Autochthonia","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1047-vampire-hunter-d","name":"vampire hunter D","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1047_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1727"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-04-30T05:07:00-07:00","id":1213381,"title":"","content":"I'm kind of obsessed with the line &quot;With the gods, it is always Now&quot; from The Gods of Pegana, so I occasionally play with the thought of some kind of Artifact that could have the line as the name of an Evocation.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><span style=\"color:#00ffff\">I have approximate knowledge of many things.</span><br /> <a href=\"https://forum.rpg.net/index.php?threads/wip-xenoblade-chronicles-the-sword-can-see-the-future.835575/\" target=\"_blank\">Write up as I play Xenoblade Chronicles.</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/158-isator-levi","name":"Isator Levi","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar158_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"17901"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-04-30T05:12:33-07:00","id":1213382,"title":"","content":"Fate's Noble Phantasms are always some good inspiration, tho because there so variable some would work better as charms really. One thing I'm really curious in seeing stated out would Ea, even if that's a little too much.<br /> <br /> As for actual mythology and literature, stuff like the Rheingold from Wagner's play would be interesting, so would that Apple from the legend of Troy, you know a general artifacts that just fucks the world up just by being there, tho I have to find out how I can bring that about from the mechanical perspective.<br /> <br /> Stuff from Brandon Sandersons stuff would also be cool, like that Honorblades or Nightblood.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><span style=\"color:#b22222\"><b>.</b></span>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3742-iceblade44","name":"Iceblade44","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Aug 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"707"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-04-30T05:20:01-07:00","id":1213383,"title":"","content":"Kyoukai Senjou no Horizon's <i>Logismoi Oplo </i>could be interesting artifacts.<br /> <br /> <a href=\"http://genesis-horizon.wikia.com/wiki/Mortal_Sin_Armaments\" target=\"_blank\">http://genesis-horizon.wikia.com/wik..._Sin_Armaments</a>","signature":"","edited":{"userid":8890,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/8890-nullapostle","user":"NullApostle","date":". 04-30-2018, 08:52 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/8890-nullapostle","name":"NullApostle","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar8890_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"202"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-04-30T06:01:51-07:00","id":1213398,"title":"","content":"Going back to Dark Souls, I actually completed the second phase Abyss Watcher\u2019s flaming sword. I\u2019m still really happy with that one.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>formerly Tornado Wolf, formerly Inugami","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/636-sunder-the-gold","name":"Sunder the Gold","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar636_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5515"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-04-30T09:58:58-07:00","id":1213471,"title":"","content":"Artifacts I fully intend to refluff and put in Exalted:<br /> <br /> Zeus's lightning bolts (I am thinking a Primordial War era weapon, a spear thrower that hurls lightning).<br /> <br /> Everything from Lord of Light by Roger Zelazny, but especially a First Age prayer wheel that offers reincarnation into a newly created body...chosen based on your intimacies and how loyal you are to some long dead Solar overlord.<br /> <br /> The hide of the Nemean lion. Impenetrable armor with a weakness to getting grappled oughta be fun to stat up.<br /> <br /> The Palantir from LOTR, because long distance scrying/communication devices oughta be rare and valuable in Exalted...but the idea that many are lost and you don't know who else could be watching is excellent story fodder.<br /> <br /> Invisible sword from...some old fantasy novel...was it the Riddle Master of Hed books? Anyways, it was just a sword...but invisible, which offers a number of combat and stealth advantages. Fertile ground for evocations but learn Call the Blade so you don't lose it!<br /> <br /> Gonna steal the Keys from Keychain of Creation, obviously...<br /> <br /> I recently played through Never Alone with my partner, and I wanna make an Adze made by a giant that can splinter mountains and cause massive blizzards now.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><i>So I'm making <a href=\"http://godkickingboot.smackjeeves.com/\" target=\"_blank\">God-Kicking Boot</a>, an Exalted webcomic, now. Updates on Sundays. Full-color, mediocre but slowly improving art. It's a thing.<br /> <br /> The absence of a monument can, in its own way, be something of a monument also.</i> -Roger Zelazny","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":4}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/512-wise-old-guru","name":"Wise Old Guru","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar512_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1097"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-04-30T14:47:26-07:00","id":1213535,"title":"","content":"Zeus' lightning bolts, already stated upthread. I'm thinking of a javelin that's made of Blue Jade instead of Orichalcum, so DBs can resonate with it. Plain Blue Jade seems a bit ugly in my mind, and lightning tends to be whitish anyway. So a Blue Jade handle affixing together two pieces of blue-white &quot;crystal-lightning&quot; that bend in a jagged way in order to give off the appearance of the artefact being one large bolt of lightning. Want this to have Evocations that empower both Thrown and Melee, because I'd like to see more artefact weapons that aren't tied to a single ability.<br /> <br /> Absolutely no ideas what Evocations it should have, hence why I'm posting it here.<br /> <br /> Few other things from Mythology and other sources, such as Aegis, Gae Bolg, or the Ring of Nibelung. No idea, again, what they should be like.<br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2388-nilihum","name":"Nilihum","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2388_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"173"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-04-30T15:36:45-07:00","id":1213546,"title":"","content":"Manus's staff-axe-thing from Dark Souls.<br /> Thunderbolts (I'd just make it a returning one, Orichalcum and Blue Jade)<br /> Posiedon's trident<br /> The Mirror Shield from Dark Souls 2<br /> the Sharur, a weapon that turns into a lion.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>The Book of Laughing Serpents Series(Latest <a href=\"https://www.storytellersvault.com/product/293793/Book-of-Laughing-Serpents-Volume-7\" target=\"_blank\">Here</a>)<br /> <a href=\"https://www.storytellersvault.com/product/287741/Many-Limbed-Manual?src=hottest_filtered&amp;filters=45622\" target=\"_blank\">Many Limbed Manual</a><br /> Patreon here: <a href=\"https://patreon.com/undeadauthorsociety\" target=\"_blank\">https://patreon.com/undeadauthorsociety</a><br /> San Jeanro Co-Op writer. Volume 1 <a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/product/278871/The-Short-Games-Digest-Volume-1\" target=\"_blank\">here</a> Volume 2 <a href=\"https://t.co/SXRLElZlw4?amp=1\" target=\"_blank\">here</a> Volume 3 <a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/product/297692/The-Short-Games-Digest-Volume-3?affiliate_id=389642\" target=\"_blank\">here</a><br /> My folklore and horror blog, here:<a href=\"http://undeadauthorsociety.wordpres.com/\" target=\"_blank\">http://undeadauthorsociety.com</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/11835-epee102","name":"Epee102","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar11835_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2102"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-04-30T16:03:23-07:00","id":1213557,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Nilihum</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1213229-from-anime-literature-and-more-artifacts-you-wanna-make?p=1213535#post1213535\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Zeus' lightning bolts, already stated upthread. I'm thinking of a javelin that's made of Blue Jade instead of Orichalcum, so DBs can resonate with it. </div> </div> </div> </div>\u200bKeep in mind that specific Artifacts can have their own resonance conditions regardless of their magical material. Gorgon is made from white jade, but is also resonant with Abyssals.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><span style=\"color:#00ffff\">I have approximate knowledge of many things.</span><br /> <a href=\"https://forum.rpg.net/index.php?threads/wip-xenoblade-chronicles-the-sword-can-see-the-future.835575/\" target=\"_blank\">Write up as I play Xenoblade Chronicles.</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":3}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/158-isator-levi","name":"Isator Levi","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar158_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"17901"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-04-30T20:34:26-07:00","id":1213645,"title":"","content":"Oh man. There are a lot. Let's see. <i>Nightblood</i> from Sanderson's book Warbreaker. A sentient sword imbued with the desire and need to fighting &quot;evil&quot;. Given that it is a sword, and has a <b>very</b> limited grasp of human morality this has mixed results.<br /> <br /> Anything from Saberhagen's Book of Swords. But specifically <i>Townsaver</i>, which will straight up wield the user to defend others to the point of mortal injury, <i>Shieldbreaker, </i>the user of whom can't be defeated by any created weapon (the sword will literally not allow it), and <i>Soulcutter</i>, which when drawn radiates such an intense feeling of horror and despair that every living thing for miles will fall into catatonia and eventually die of neglect. <br /> <br /> <i>Tiger Soul</i> from Weapons of the Gods is another good one. It's entire purpose is destruction. Given enough chi it can literally destroy anything. But it will not allow itself to destroy the world, as then it wouldn't be able to fulfill it's purpose. From the same: <i>Heaven's Crystal</i>, the Monk-King of Weapons. All mortal weapons fall down in abasement and homage to it.<br /> <br /> The epynonymous <i>Sword of Shannara</i> is also a good candidate, it's power is to make whoever holds it or is cut by it see Truth. Absolute, unvarnished, with all the selfish reasonings stripped bare. It's much more effective than it sounds.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/8807-galatine","name":"Galatine","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"42"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-04-30T21:16:59-07:00","id":1213665,"title":"","content":"How about the weapons from the Dungeons&amp;Dragons cartoon?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1047-vampire-hunter-d","name":"vampire hunter D","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1047_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1727"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-04-30T21:23:42-07:00","id":1213667,"title":"","content":"Oh! That SCP sword that kills people, but sends their souls to a town in metal bodies. (Soulsteel I believe)","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>The Book of Laughing Serpents Series(Latest <a href=\"https://www.storytellersvault.com/product/293793/Book-of-Laughing-Serpents-Volume-7\" target=\"_blank\">Here</a>)<br /> <a href=\"https://www.storytellersvault.com/product/287741/Many-Limbed-Manual?src=hottest_filtered&amp;filters=45622\" target=\"_blank\">Many Limbed Manual</a><br /> Patreon here: <a href=\"https://patreon.com/undeadauthorsociety\" target=\"_blank\">https://patreon.com/undeadauthorsociety</a><br /> San Jeanro Co-Op writer. Volume 1 <a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/product/278871/The-Short-Games-Digest-Volume-1\" target=\"_blank\">here</a> Volume 2 <a href=\"https://t.co/SXRLElZlw4?amp=1\" target=\"_blank\">here</a> Volume 3 <a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/product/297692/The-Short-Games-Digest-Volume-3?affiliate_id=389642\" target=\"_blank\">here</a><br /> My folklore and horror blog, here:<a href=\"http://undeadauthorsociety.wordpres.com/\" target=\"_blank\">http://undeadauthorsociety.com</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/11835-epee102","name":"Epee102","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar11835_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2102"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-05-01T18:15:20-07:00","id":1213991,"title":"","content":"How about an Atma Weapon ( FF VI)? A daiklaive that deals damage based on your health levels.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1047-vampire-hunter-d","name":"vampire hunter D","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1047_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1727"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-05-01T18:19:16-07:00","id":1213995,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>vampire hunter D</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1213229-from-anime-literature-and-more-artifacts-you-wanna-make?p=1213991#post1213991\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">How about an Atma Weapon ( FF VI)? A daiklaive that deals damage based on your health levels.</div> </div> </div> </div><div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Sunder the Gold</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1213229-from-anime-literature-and-more-artifacts-you-wanna-make?p=1213234#post1213234\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I have some vague plans for an adamant sword based on Cloud Strife's Ultima Weapon.</div> </div> </div> </div>Cloud's Ultimate Weapon had a crystal clear blade that got cloudier as he lost HP.<br /> <br /> So, I figured it could be an adamant sword which evoked the cutting sharpness of adamant most powerfully as long as your mind was clear as glass. The more you suffer penalties from wounds, sickness, poison, fear, or hatred, the less powerful the sword would become.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>formerly Tornado Wolf, formerly Inugami","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/636-sunder-the-gold","name":"Sunder the Gold","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar636_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5515"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-05-01T21:03:09-07:00","id":1214033,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Wise Old Guru</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1213229-from-anime-literature-and-more-artifacts-you-wanna-make?p=1213471#post1213471\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Artifacts I fully intend to refluff and put in Exalted:...<br /> <br /> Invisible sword from...some old fantasy novel...was it the Riddle Master of Hed books? Anyways, it was just a sword...but invisible, which offers a number of combat and stealth advantages. Fertile ground for evocations but learn Call the Blade so you don't lose it!...</div> </div> </div> </div>Possibly a short story by Roger Zelazny for Dilvish the Damned? There was a prophecy along the lines of, &quot;You will never see the sword that kills you.&quot; so Horhoga's (?) enemy(s) made one that was invisible. It was laying around for Dilvish to find by accident in the story; I believe he cut himself on it.<br /> <br />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Like my Avatar? Courtesy of<span style=\"color:#0000FF\"> Jen</span>! : <span style=\"font-size:12px\">Anybody want their characters to be experimented on ? </span>post 98<br /> <i>An Exalt is never unarmed.</i>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4018-l-het-esh","name":"L'het'esh","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar4018_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"521"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-05-01T21:07:49-07:00","id":1214035,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Sunder the Gold</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1213229-from-anime-literature-and-more-artifacts-you-wanna-make?p=1213995#post1213995\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> Cloud's Ultimate Weapon had a crystal clear blade that got cloudier as he lost HP.<br /> <br /> So, I figured it could be an adamant sword which evoked the cutting sharpness of adamant most powerfully as long as your mind was clear as glass. The more you suffer penalties from wounds, sickness, poison, fear, or hatred, the less powerful the sword would become.</div> </div> </div> </div>Those are two different swords though. The Buster Sword and anything Cloud used would be Grand Daiklaives though","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1047-vampire-hunter-d","name":"vampire hunter D","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1047_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1727"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-05-01T22:57:10-07:00","id":1214050,"title":"","content":"I'm still wondering how to number crunch Monsoon's power armor in Metal Gear Rising. Especially the splitting in parts thing.<br /> Other than that, some kind of &quot;group of weapons&quot;. Biggest contender would be a variation of Dresden Files' Knights of the Cross.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3657-sagara","name":"Sagara","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3657_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Aug 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"162"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-05-02T00:30:03-07:00","id":1214068,"title":"","content":"In <i>Dark Souls</i>, there's a type of weapon upgrade called &quot;Crystal&quot; which comes with a unique cost/benefit. The Benefit is that the weapons do a <i>LOT</i> of damage compared to other upgrade paths, the downside is that Crystal weapons degrade really fast <i><b>and cannot be repaired</b></i>. They break sooner or later and you've lost them.<br /> <br /> In <i>Fate/Stay Night</i>, the character called &quot;Archer&quot; can spontaneously generate knockoff versions of legendary artifacts, which are weaker than the real thing and don't have all of what would be EX3's evocations. Maybe you can see where I'm going with this.<br /> <br /> I designed<i><b> Crystalline </b></i><i><i><b>S</b><b>liv</b></i></i><b><i>er of the Infinite, </i></b> also known as the &quot;Crystal Lightning Blade&quot; and &quot;Frozen Moonlight&quot;, which is an artifact that lets you spontaneously generate swords that shatter on a decisive attack but have a bunch of useful properties.<br /> * * *<br /> <br /> A weapon that I want to convert is the <i><b>Speaking Gun</b></i> from the <i>Nightside</i> series. It's made from the rib of biblical Lilith, and it hates everything that ever is, was and shall be. When fired, it speaks The Word of God (i.e. the words for &quot;Let There Be X&quot;) <b>in reverse</b>, unmaking the thing that is was fired at. It is the single most powerful weapon in the entirety of the Multiversal Planes of Existence. Obviously, it needs to be changed a bit to fit in the setting, but I want to make it an artifact built by The Bishop of the Chalcedony Thurible, forged from the anti-flesh of a Neverborn.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Please be warned: this is not champagne, this is most likely a duck.<br /> -<i>Chausse</i><br /> <br /> <span style=\"color:#800080\"><i>Message me for Japanese translations.</i></span>","edited":{"userid":8830,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/8830-sorcerous-overlord","user":"Sorcerous Overlord","date":".  Edit: corrected 05-02-2018, 11:47 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/8830-sorcerous-overlord","name":"Sorcerous Overlord","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar8830_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"873"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-05-02T04:41:24-07:00","id":1214107,"title":"","content":"I'm currently in the process of designing an Artifact based on the FFXIV Astrologian's weapon, Star Globe. (A divination tool that is a combination of tarot-like constellation cards, and an astrolabe)<br /> <br /> Still pondering whether to base the divination cards on the Five Maidens, or on the FFXIV constellations that the original Astrologian uses","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/15678-cenrei","name":"Cenrei","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar15678_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Aug 2017"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"73"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-05-02T06:00:30-07:00","id":1214117,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>vampire hunter D</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1213229-from-anime-literature-and-more-artifacts-you-wanna-make?p=1214035#post1214035\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> Those are two different swords though. The Buster Sword and anything Cloud used would be Grand Daiklaives though</div> </div> </div> </div>Apologies, you were talking about the light-saber thing from game with Terra Branford.<br /> <br /> Anyway, the problem remains that almost everything in Exalted is designed to ramp up over the course of a fight rather than start at full power and wane as the fight drags on. Combat healing isn\u2019t as simple as in an JRPG.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>formerly Tornado Wolf, formerly Inugami","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/636-sunder-the-gold","name":"Sunder the Gold","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar636_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5515"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-05-02T06:17:42-07:00","id":1214124,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Sorcerous Overlord</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1213229-from-anime-literature-and-more-artifacts-you-wanna-make?p=1214068#post1214068\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">equivalent to about a +10 weapon but with only the requirements of making a +5 weapon, and the damage is normal and straightforward, no cheese strategies like farming a resource required.</div> </div> </div> </div>\u200bWhat? <br /> <br /> \u200bCrystal can only be placed on weapons that have already been upgraded to +10, and requires titanite chunks and slabs to upgrade; those are the requirements of making a normal weapon go up to +<b>15</b>.<br /> <br /> \u200bThey're also among the rarest forms of titanite in the game, and so uncommon that it's definitely necessary to farm them from the very small number of difficult to kill enemies in the game that drop them if one want to fully upgrade a crystal weapon.<br />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><span style=\"color:#00ffff\">I have approximate knowledge of many things.</span><br /> <a href=\"https://forum.rpg.net/index.php?threads/wip-xenoblade-chronicles-the-sword-can-see-the-future.835575/\" target=\"_blank\">Write up as I play Xenoblade Chronicles.</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/158-isator-levi","name":"Isator Levi","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar158_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"17901"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-05-02T16:32:45-07:00","id":1214355,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>L'het'esh</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1213229-from-anime-literature-and-more-artifacts-you-wanna-make?p=1214033#post1214033\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Possibly a short story by Roger Zelazny for Dilvish the Damned? There was a prophecy along the lines of, &amp;quot;You will never see the sword that kills you.&amp;quot; so Horhoga's (?) enemy(s) made one that was invisible. It was laying around for Dilvish to find by accident in the story; I believe he cut himself on it.<br /></div> </div> </div> </div>That's it! Thanks, it's been ages since I read the Dilvish books.<br /> <br /> ... okay, also I need to stat up his horse, though as a Familiar or as an artifact with evocations I am unsure.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><i>So I'm making <a href=\"http://godkickingboot.smackjeeves.com/\" target=\"_blank\">God-Kicking Boot</a>, an Exalted webcomic, now. Updates on Sundays. Full-color, mediocre but slowly improving art. It's a thing.<br /> <br /> The absence of a monument can, in its own way, be something of a monument also.</i> -Roger Zelazny","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/512-wise-old-guru","name":"Wise Old Guru","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar512_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1097"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-05-02T17:02:07-07:00","id":1214363,"title":"","content":"Oh Jesus, did I seriously argue with somebody about the minutiae of Dark Souls upgrade paths? Maybe I <i>shouldn't</i> participate in the network test next week... <br /> <br /> \u200b<span style=\"font-size:8px\">(imstillgoingtoiloveitsomuch)</span><br /> <br /> <div align=\"left\"><span style=\"color:#252C2F\"><span style=\"font-family:Helvetica\"><span style=\"font-size:13px\">So anyway, one thing that I've been thinking of is the depiction of magical weapons that I don't actually like and have been critical of, for how insignificant their powers seem, both in a general sense and particularly when they seem to be overshadowed by the capabilities of those using them.<br /> <br /> \u200bSo I'm wondering about possibilities in taking those insignificant things and redeeming them with the kinds of expanded powers that they might have here.<br /> <br /> \u200bOff the top of my head... the sword of Gryffindor from Harry Potter. The idea that it imbues qualities to make it stronger and responds to displays of need and worthiness might be something that can be expanded upon, perhaps in a combination of temporarily adopting qualities from enemies (perhaps especially or exclusively creatures of darkness) that it is up against, escalated to varying degrees (I could see it, say, starting of as bestowing bonuses to attack rolls by absorbing power from parried attacks, building up towards something as dramatic as being able to ape an enemy's attack power for a scene), combined with certain enabling of or incentive to attack with fierceness and bravery.<br /> <br /> Hmm, maybe give it some chimera symbolism; a leonine core atop which various monstrous oddities can be placed.<br /> <br /> \u200bI'm seeing... moonsilver, with orichalcum accents.</span></span></span></div>","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><span style=\"color:#00ffff\">I have approximate knowledge of many things.</span><br /> <a href=\"https://forum.rpg.net/index.php?threads/wip-xenoblade-chronicles-the-sword-can-see-the-future.835575/\" target=\"_blank\">Write up as I play Xenoblade Chronicles.</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/158-isator-levi","name":"Isator Levi","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar158_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"17901"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-05-02T20:45:38-07:00","id":1214410,"title":"","content":"Edit: corrected.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Please be warned: this is not champagne, this is most likely a duck.<br /> -<i>Chausse</i><br /> <br /> <span style=\"color:#800080\"><i>Message me for Japanese translations.</i></span>","edited":{"userid":8830,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/8830-sorcerous-overlord","user":"Sorcerous Overlord","date":". 05-02-2018, 11:48 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/8830-sorcerous-overlord","name":"Sorcerous Overlord","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar8830_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"873"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-05-02T22:07:38-07:00","id":1214422,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Sorcerous Overlord</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1213229-from-anime-literature-and-more-artifacts-you-wanna-make?p=1214068#post1214068\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">A weapon that I want to convert is the <i><b>Speaking Gun</b></i> from the <i>Nightside</i> series. It's made from the rib of biblical Lilith, and it hates everything that ever is, was and shall be. When fired, it speaks The Word of God (i.e. the words for &quot;Let There Be X&quot;) <b>in reverse</b>, unmaking the thing that is was fired at. It is the single most powerful weapon in the entirety of the Multiversal Planes of Existence. Obviously, it needs to be changed a bit to fit in the setting, but I want to make it an artifact built by The Bishop of the Chalcedony Thurible, forged from the anti-flesh of a Neverborn.</div> </div> </div> </div>It could take some queues from Karvara, I bet.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/13313-sith_happens","name":"Sith_Happens","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar13313_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2017"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1177"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-05-02T23:29:33-07:00","id":1214435,"title":"","content":"here's a few:<br /> <br /> Tetsuaiga, Tenseiga, Tokijin, Bakusaiga, Hiraikos","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1047-vampire-hunter-d","name":"vampire hunter D","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1047_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1727"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-05-03T05:39:56-07:00","id":1214549,"title":"","content":"An artifact quiver of trick arrows.<br /> <br /> The attunement bonus is that it never runs out of high quality arrows of the piercing or fouling types. <br /> <br /> Each Evocation represents a trick arrow you can pull out, each one with its own reset timing and conditions. Grappling-rope arrows (with the quiver producing lots of rope), explosive arrows, net arrows, glue arrows, scatter arrows, sonic arrows...","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>formerly Tornado Wolf, formerly Inugami","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":4}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/636-sunder-the-gold","name":"Sunder the Gold","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar636_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5515"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-05-03T07:00:44-07:00","id":1214584,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Sunder the Gold</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1213229-from-anime-literature-and-more-artifacts-you-wanna-make?p=1214549#post1214549\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">An artifact quiver of trick arrows.<br /> <br /> The attunement bonus is that it never runs out of high quality arrows of the piercing or fouling types.<br /> <br /> Each Evocation represents a trick arrow you can pull out, each one with its own reset timing and conditions. Grappling-rope arrows (with the quiver producing lots of rope), explosive arrows, net arrows, glue arrows, scatter arrows, sonic arrows...</div> </div> </div> </div>\u200bThat's really cool.<br /> <br /> Would you see it as a case of Evocations expanding laterally to acquire different types, or vertically based on how useful and powerful the arrows might be?","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><span style=\"color:#00ffff\">I have approximate knowledge of many things.</span><br /> <a href=\"https://forum.rpg.net/index.php?threads/wip-xenoblade-chronicles-the-sword-can-see-the-future.835575/\" target=\"_blank\">Write up as I play Xenoblade Chronicles.</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/158-isator-levi","name":"Isator Levi","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar158_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"17901"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-05-03T07:10:28-07:00","id":1214587,"title":"","content":"Saika, from the anime Durarara. To elaborate: it's a cursed, sentient sword that loves humans and humanity in general. Unfortunately, it's a sword. So the only way it is able to express that love is by cutting. Funnily enough, this works from Saika's perspective since people cut by it become possessed by its &quot;love&quot; and fully devoted to helping spread the affection.<br /> <br /> I could see it being a Soulsteel Reaper Daiklaive made from the soul of a Chosen of Serenity. Maybe made as a sick joke by the Lover. Evocations would probably revolve arround instilling intimacies.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/8807-galatine","name":"Galatine","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"42"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-05-03T07:47:08-07:00","id":1214598,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Isator Levi</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1213229-from-anime-literature-and-more-artifacts-you-wanna-make?p=1214584#post1214584\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> \u200bThat's really cool.<br /> <br /> Would you see it as a case of Evocations expanding laterally to acquire different types, or vertically based on how useful and powerful the arrows might be?</div> </div> </div> </div>Mostly lateral, since this is explicitly designed and intended to be a literal grab-bag of tricks. The only common element is \u201cat least vaguely like an arrow\u201d.<br /> <br /> But not entirely lateral. Some of the trick arrows might need to be broken into multiple Evocations to balance their power or the number of tricks you can employ with a particular arrow. And some trick arrows are reasonably represented as advanced combinations of lesser trick arrows.<br /> <br /> It might also be cool if the Tricky Quiver is unusually capable of forming relational Evocations with unrelated artifact bows, to provide them trick arrows uniquely suited to the kinds of tricks those bows usually produce entirely on their own.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>formerly Tornado Wolf, formerly Inugami","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/636-sunder-the-gold","name":"Sunder the Gold","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar636_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5515"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-05-03T08:37:32-07:00","id":1214621,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Sunder the Gold</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1213229-from-anime-literature-and-more-artifacts-you-wanna-make?p=1214598#post1214598\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> Mostly lateral, since this is explicitly designed and intended to be a literal grab-bag of tricks. The only common element is \u201cat least vaguely like an arrow\u201d.<br /> <br /> But not entirely lateral. Some of the trick arrows might need to be broken into multiple Evocations to balance their power or the number of tricks you can employ with a particular arrow. And some trick arrows are reasonably represented as advanced combinations of lesser trick arrows.<br /> <br /> It might also be cool if the Tricky Quiver is unusually capable of forming relational Evocations with unrelated artifact bows, to provide them trick arrows uniquely suited to the kinds of tricks those bows usually produce entirely on their own.</div> </div> </div> </div>This is the most evocative idea I've seen on here in a while. This feels like writing Green Arrow. Now I want to write it...","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>I post Artifacts in <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/823884-3e-the-artifact-and-evocation-workshop\" target=\"_blank\">this thread</a>. How I make them is in <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/828820-how-to-write-artifacts-and-evocations\" target=\"_blank\">this thread</a>.<br /> I have made many tools and other things for 3rd Edition. I now host all of my creations on my Google site: <a href=\"https://sites.google.com/site/unsungherovault/home\" target=\"_blank\">The Vault of the Unsung Hero</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/368-the-unsung-hero","name":"The Unsung Hero","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar368_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2288"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-05-03T09:19:07-07:00","id":1214638,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>The Unsung Hero</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1213229-from-anime-literature-and-more-artifacts-you-wanna-make?p=1214621#post1214621\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> This is the most evocative idea I've seen on here in a while. This feels like writing Green Arrow. Now I want to write it...</div> </div> </div> </div>I will be happy as long as there is a Boxing glove arrow.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/8807-galatine","name":"Galatine","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"42"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-05-03T09:57:13-07:00","id":1214655,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Galatine</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1213229-from-anime-literature-and-more-artifacts-you-wanna-make?p=1214638#post1214638\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> I will be happy as long as there is a Boxing glove arrow.</div> </div> </div> </div>Boomerang Arrow!","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><i>So I'm making <a href=\"http://godkickingboot.smackjeeves.com/\" target=\"_blank\">God-Kicking Boot</a>, an Exalted webcomic, now. Updates on Sundays. Full-color, mediocre but slowly improving art. It's a thing.<br /> <br /> The absence of a monument can, in its own way, be something of a monument also.</i> -Roger Zelazny","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/512-wise-old-guru","name":"Wise Old Guru","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar512_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1097"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-05-03T10:09:49-07:00","id":1214660,"title":"","content":"<a href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Trick_arrows\" target=\"_blank\">Extensive, if not comprehensive list.</a>","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>I post Artifacts in <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/823884-3e-the-artifact-and-evocation-workshop\" target=\"_blank\">this thread</a>. How I make them is in <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/828820-how-to-write-artifacts-and-evocations\" target=\"_blank\">this thread</a>.<br /> I have made many tools and other things for 3rd Edition. I now host all of my creations on my Google site: <a href=\"https://sites.google.com/site/unsungherovault/home\" target=\"_blank\">The Vault of the Unsung Hero</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/368-the-unsung-hero","name":"The Unsung Hero","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar368_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2288"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-05-03T11:04:08-07:00","id":1214685,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Wise Old Guru</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1213229-from-anime-literature-and-more-artifacts-you-wanna-make?p=1214355#post1214355\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">That's it! Thanks, it's been ages since I read the Dilvish books.<br /> <br /> ... okay, also I need to stat up his horse, though as a Familiar or as an artifact with evocations I am unsure.</div> </div> </div> </div>I'd go demon, since there was a contract of sorts, but you do whatever seems closer or is more fun. Er, Exalted, so do what ever is closer or is more over the top.<br /> <br />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Like my Avatar? Courtesy of<span style=\"color:#0000FF\"> Jen</span>! : <span style=\"font-size:12px\">Anybody want their characters to be experimented on ? </span>post 98<br /> <i>An Exalt is never unarmed.</i>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4018-l-het-esh","name":"L'het'esh","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar4018_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"521"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-05-03T11:05:45-07:00","id":1214686,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Galatine</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1213229-from-anime-literature-and-more-artifacts-you-wanna-make?p=1214638#post1214638\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I will be happy as long as there is a Boxing glove arrow.</div> </div> </div> </div> Why limit yourself? Every arrow ever used by Green Arrow, Hawkeye, <i>or in a cartoon.</i><br /> <br />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Like my Avatar? Courtesy of<span style=\"color:#0000FF\"> Jen</span>! : <span style=\"font-size:12px\">Anybody want their characters to be experimented on ? </span>post 98<br /> <i>An Exalt is never unarmed.</i>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4018-l-het-esh","name":"L'het'esh","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar4018_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"521"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-05-03T17:19:01-07:00","id":1214844,"title":"","content":"Honestly, I've got a list of classic Artifacts from First and Second edition that I'm dismayed haven't already been converted. I'm going to take the plunge and try to do it myself. Starting with Soul Mirror.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/11867-caffeine-delusions","name":"Caffeine Delusions","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar11867_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"117"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-05-04T00:19:38-07:00","id":1214953,"title":"","content":"Saw Infinity War, now have an itch to make the Infinity Gauntlet in Exalted. My vision is the gauntlet is made from Autocthon's metal-flesh, and the Infinity Gems are made from each of the Magical Materials, bestowing control over that metal's aspects. <br /> <br /> Orichalcum Gem = can channel raw, destructive power and manipulate light<br /> <br /> Moonsilver Gem = can transform things, internally or externally<br /> <br /> Starmetal Gem = can manipulate fate and time<br /> <br /> Soulsteel Gem = can manipulate ghosts&amp;undead, with sufficient power can even manipulate souls still inside mortal bodies<br /> <br /> Jade Gem = can manipulate elements and emotions","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/15678-cenrei","name":"Cenrei","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar15678_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Aug 2017"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"73"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-05-04T09:54:58-07:00","id":1215117,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Cenrei</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1213229-from-anime-literature-and-more-artifacts-you-wanna-make?p=1214953#post1214953\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Saw Infinity War, now have an itch to make the Infinity Gauntlet in Exalted. My vision is the gauntlet is made from Autocthon's metal-flesh, and the Infinity Gems are made from each of the Magical Materials, bestowing control over that metal's aspects.<br /> <br /> Orichalcum Gem = can channel raw, destructive power and manipulate light<br /> <br /> Moonsilver Gem = can transform things, internally or externally<br /> <br /> Starmetal Gem = can manipulate fate and time<br /> <br /> Soulsteel Gem = can manipulate ghosts&amp;undead, with sufficient power can even manipulate souls still inside mortal bodies<br /> <br /> Jade Gem = can manipulate elements and emotions</div> </div> </div> </div>If this is going to be an Autochthonian thing, then you can very reasonably include an Adamant Gem that can manipulate reality/perception.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><hr />&quot;The true object of all human life is play. Earth is a task garden; heaven is a playground.&quot; -G.K. Chesterton","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":3}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/53-blackwingedheaven","name":"blackwingedheaven","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar53_3.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"351"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-05-04T14:35:48-07:00","id":1215236,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Cenrei</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1213229-from-anime-literature-and-more-artifacts-you-wanna-make?p=1214953#post1214953\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Saw Infinity War, now have an itch to make the Infinity Gauntlet in Exalted. My vision is the gauntlet is made from Autocthon's metal-flesh, and the Infinity Gems are made from each of the Magical Materials, bestowing control over that metal's aspects. <br /> <br /> Orichalcum Gem = can channel raw, destructive power and manipulate light<br /> <br /> Moonsilver Gem = can transform things, internally or externally<br /> <br /> Starmetal Gem = can manipulate fate and time<br /> <br /> Soulsteel Gem = can manipulate ghosts&amp;undead, with sufficient power can even manipulate souls still inside mortal bodies<br /> <br /> Jade Gem = can manipulate elements and emotions</div> </div> </div> </div>Luckily, no one has ever seen the Adamant Gem so thete's no way he can get it<br /> <br /> But, wouldnt a Hand of the Maker equiped with a Proto Shimaic Vortex be close enought to the Gauntlet?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1047-vampire-hunter-d","name":"vampire hunter D","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1047_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1727"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-05-05T09:46:26-07:00","id":1215534,"title":"","content":"Proto Shinmaic Vortex rings some bells, but I can't say I remember hearing about a Hand of the Maker before?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/15678-cenrei","name":"Cenrei","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar15678_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Aug 2017"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"73"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-05-06T04:39:44-07:00","id":1215735,"title":"","content":"Someday, maybe even soon, I intend to sit down and convert some of the bigger ticket <span style=\"color:#545454\"><span style=\"font-family:arial\">Mad\u014dgu </span></span>from Flame of Recca. Ensui or Fujin are <i>prime</i> Evocation material.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>---------------------------------------------<br /> Supporter of Spirits getting full playable splat design come Exalted 3E.<br /> Refugee from the 3rd Great Edition Wars of D&amp;D. <br /> oWoD Latecomer, Exalted Optimist, Scion ST, Trinity Curious","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/955-yue-ryong","name":"Yue Ryong","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar955_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"147"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-05-06T08:06:33-07:00","id":1215793,"title":"","content":"The Blades of Twilight from Arrixam's works. It's a weapon that can take the form of the most powerful weapon the user can imagine and imbue it with the power of Dusk and Dawn.<br /> <br /> The one that uses it in the Arryverse chose humanity as his weapon, and thus it could take on the forms of any human he has absorbed through his other powers. Besides the whole 'create doppleganger' aspect, he can also channel some of his other powers through his 'Dusk Blades', switch places with them at will, and have dozens of them active at a time.<br /> <br /> I could see it as a Soulsteel/Orichalcum + Moonsilver weapon, with a particular affinity to Lunars and Abyssals. I would probably need to limit the number of active Dusk Blades though, maybe remove active Forms from a Lunar's Heartsblood Libary temporarily as well as limiting the channeling powers option by the proxy's own Traits, but it can probably work well enough.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12398-darchon5","name":"DArchon5","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"137"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-05-14T18:40:58-07:00","id":1218754,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Knurlurzhad</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1213229-from-anime-literature-and-more-artifacts-you-wanna-make?p=1213360#post1213360\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Right now I'm working on the Holy Moonlight Sword (the Bloodborne version)</div> </div> </div> </div>\u200bHeh, I forgot about the significance of some of these; the mythology of Bloodborne is such where we actually get a certain greater prominence of heroic figures of yore, and the personal relationships that they had with their weapons, or philosophies expressed therein.<br /> <br /> \u200bThe Burial Blade, a scythe made to be a dirge of farewell, striking with the hope that prey might rest in peace.<br /> <br /> The Rakuyo, an elegant weapon carried by a woman who disdained her families use of blood weapons, until a sacrifice and a dedication on her part led to her powering her own blades with blood.<br /> <br /> \u200bAnd, as this person said, Ludwig's true mentor, his guiding Moonlight, by his side all along. Just a hair, a fleeting thing, though he clung to it, steeped as he was in the stench of blood and beasts.<br /> <br /> \u200bHe never wanted to know, what it really was. Really, he didn't...<br />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><span style=\"color:#00ffff\">I have approximate knowledge of many things.</span><br /> <a href=\"https://forum.rpg.net/index.php?threads/wip-xenoblade-chronicles-the-sword-can-see-the-future.835575/\" target=\"_blank\">Write up as I play Xenoblade Chronicles.</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/158-isator-levi","name":"Isator Levi","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar158_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"17901"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-05-16T23:39:27-07:00","id":1219545,"title":"","content":"I would definitively want to see someone manage to make an exalted version of the &quot;G\u00e1e Bolg&quot;<br /> <br /> Whilst it would probably be a green jade spear, it's so damn gruesome that it would be right up abyssal alley.<br /> <br /> another one would probably be L\u00e6vateinn. Having a sword that you just commands and have fight for you is something that's pretty neat.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>I'm making the Tales of Exalts webcomic<br /> <a href=\"http://xanroth.deviantart.com/gallery/50854781/tales-of-exalts\" target=\"_blank\">http://xanroth.deviantart.com/galler...ales-of-exalts</a><br /> alchemical report <a href=\"http://xanroth.deviantart.com/gallery/54812164/Alchemical-Report\" target=\"_blank\">http://xanroth.deviantart.com/galler...hemical-Report</a><br /> the fall <a href=\"http://xanroth.deviantart.com/gallery/55265686/the-fall\" target=\"_blank\">http://xanroth.deviantart.com/gallery/55265686/the-fall</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4455-xanroth","name":"Xanroth","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar4455_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1072"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-05-17T00:23:56-07:00","id":1219551,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Xanroth</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1213229-from-anime-literature-and-more-artifacts-you-wanna-make?p=1219545#post1219545\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I would definitively want to see someone manage to make an exalted version of the &amp;quot;G\u00e1e Bolg&amp;quot;<br /> <br /> Whilst it would probably be a green jade spear, it's so damn gruesome that it would be right up abyssal alley.<br /> <br /> another one would probably be L\u00e6vateinn. Having a sword that you just commands and have fight for you is something that's pretty neat.</div> </div> </div> </div>Gruesomeness has nothing to do with abyssals, and so Gae Bolg would definitely be a green jade Longfang. Steal sone Evocations from Burning Branch too (specifically the one that disarms people by growing branches that snag the weapon and hold it there). In fact, just refluffing Burning Branch would make for a good Gae Bolg.<br /> <br /> And we already have a Laevateinn in the Flying Silver Dream. <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/biggrin.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Big Grin\" smilieid=\"3\" class=\"inlineimg\" />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/15678-cenrei","name":"Cenrei","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar15678_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Aug 2017"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"73"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-05-17T05:15:46-07:00","id":1219583,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Isator Levi</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1213229-from-anime-literature-and-more-artifacts-you-wanna-make?p=1218754#post1218754\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">-snip-</div> </div> </div> </div>Would you terribly mind giving us more details on that soulsteel-and-Malfeas-brass daiklave you've been working on?","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>He/him","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/177-thecountalucard","name":"TheCountAlucard","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar177_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"10857"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-05-17T06:02:28-07:00","id":1219601,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Cenrei</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1213229-from-anime-literature-and-more-artifacts-you-wanna-make?p=1219551#post1219551\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> Gruesomeness has nothing to do with abyssals, and so Gae Bolg would definitely be a green jade Longfang. Steal sone Evocations from Burning Branch too (specifically the one that disarms people by growing branches that snag the weapon and hold it there). In fact, just refluffing Burning Branch would make for a good Gae Bolg.<br /> <br /> And we already have a Laevateinn in the Flying Silver Dream. <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/biggrin.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Big Grin\" smilieid=\"3\" class=\"inlineimg\" /></div> </div> </div> </div>It was mostly that the way the G\u00e1e Bolg kills people is so damn brutal that it's more or less a guaranteed ghost (if that's still the case that is.)<br /> Having spiked thorns grow into every single vein is not a nice way to go...<br /> <br /> That would make for a pretty messed up evocation.<br /> slain enemies are reduced to a thorn bush inside the stretched and pierced skin of the victim.<br /> Would probably require some fear rolls after that I would say...<br /> Or maybe have a whole dang tree grow out of them with tormented faces in it's bark...","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>I'm making the Tales of Exalts webcomic<br /> <a href=\"http://xanroth.deviantart.com/gallery/50854781/tales-of-exalts\" target=\"_blank\">http://xanroth.deviantart.com/galler...ales-of-exalts</a><br /> alchemical report <a href=\"http://xanroth.deviantart.com/gallery/54812164/Alchemical-Report\" target=\"_blank\">http://xanroth.deviantart.com/galler...hemical-Report</a><br /> the fall <a href=\"http://xanroth.deviantart.com/gallery/55265686/the-fall\" target=\"_blank\">http://xanroth.deviantart.com/gallery/55265686/the-fall</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4455-xanroth","name":"Xanroth","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar4455_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1072"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-05-17T06:22:22-07:00","id":1219606,"title":"","content":"Ant-Man\u2019s shrinking/growing suit. Moonsilver Reinforced Buff Jacket.<br /> <br /> I was plotting out its Evocations but then I got bored. Maybe it was too easy, or maybe I didn\u2019t see a point in writing it until I knew how it might interact with Lunar Charms.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>formerly Tornado Wolf, formerly Inugami","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/636-sunder-the-gold","name":"Sunder the Gold","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar63